{
	title: 'Tool instructions in their own prompt sections',
	spec: 'SYSTEM.md keeps the general tool instructions (# Tools), each tool with its own guide (READ, BASH, EDIT) and the other-tools list (# Other tools) with $other_tools in named sections, so a tool, summary or plugin change reaches a running session as a section update instead of rebuilding the system prompt and losing the provider cache. systemPrompt.inspect locates sections in text an assemble hook changed: a section whose rendered text is intact keeps it; otherwise it runs from its heading to the next later section heading or unchanged text between sections, and its body is what the hook produced. A section whose heading a hook removed is withdrawn; a hook that changes text outside every section still rebuilds.',
	status: 'done',
