		'SYSTEM.md sections: Actions (general rules), READ, BASH, EDIT, Other actions ($tools_summary). The BASH/EDIT purpose hints moved into their own sections. Plugins that rewrite a guide must anchor on its section heading (# EDIT), not on neighboring lines: multiedit.ts matched "- Commands run in cwd;" and would have stopped installing its guide silently when that line moved.',
		'Measured cost of a plugin swap before this: enabling, disabling or a .broken fallback of an EDIT plugin rebuilt every live session prompt (full cache write). Regression test in system-prompt.test.ts fails on the old inspect (hooked sections were dropped and their text counted as outside).',
